---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16">
    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-lg">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-3">About</h2>
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8">A bit about me</h3>
      <p>
        I graduated from USC's Viterbi School of Engineering with a B.S. in Computer Science
        and Business Administration, with coursework in Financial Derivatives,
        Advanced Finance, and Applied Statistics.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm currently a Technology Strategy consultant at PwC's Strategy&amp; practice in New York City, advising
        private equity firms on tech due diligence and value creation. Before that, I was a
        software engineer at Microsoft, building performance-critical systems in C++ on the
        Teams platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        I have a deep interest in markets and finance 
        — shaped by years of studying probability and risk through poker,
        where I've grown a considerable bankroll applying expected value and disciplined bankroll management. 
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm currently building finance-focused projects to learn more about how markets work
        and develop a stronger hands-on understanding of the field.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Logo column -->
    <!-- To swap in real images, replace the inner <div> placeholder with: <img src="/assets/FILENAME" alt="LABEL" class="w-full h-full object-contain p-3" /> -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 flex-shrink-0">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/usc_logo2.png" alt="USC" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">USC</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/strategy&_logo.jpeg" alt="Strategy&" class="w-[120%] h-[120%] object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Strategy&amp;</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/ms_logo.png" alt="Microsoft" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Microsoft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/poker_icon3.jpg" alt="Poker" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Poker</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
